# MCP Registry publisher
# NOTE: `server.json` is deliberately NOT ignored. It was, from #141 until
# v0.30.0, which is why the registry listing could only ever be hand-published —
# and so it drifted 43 releases behind npm. It is the tracked manifest now; the
# publish workflow stamps its version from the git tag. Only `mcp-publisher`'s
# local auth state needs ignoring.
.mcpregistry_token
